001100**                                                          **
001200**   T B K Q T R P T - QUOTE REPORT FOR A REQUIREMENT ORDER **
001300**                                                          **
001400**   THIS REPORT SUPPLIES A LISTING OF ALL QUOTES FOR ALL   **
001500**   CODED ITEMS FOR THE REQUIREMENT ORDER NUMBER           **
001600**   REQUESTED.                                             **
001700**                                                          **
001800**     XRSCREEN REPORT NO. - 44                             **
001900**     REPORT HEADER       - DHDR44.PUB                     **
002000**     FORM NAME IN FRSCREEN - FBKQTRPT                     **
002100**     QR1 ON THE PURCHASING MENU (UDCPURCH.PUB)            **
002200**                                                          **
002300**************************************************************
002700
